        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Company will pay the cost of physical examinations including the drug screening test, required by DOT regulations when the examinations are conducted at Company selected facilities. If an employee chooses to have the physical examination at a facility not selected by the Company, the employee will bear the cost of the physical examination.",
